  "description": "Operating Area: Greece\n\nBuilt by the renowned Italian shipyard Ferretti in 2008, M/Y FLOW is an elegant and highperforming motor yacht designed to deliver an exceptional charter experience for up to 8 guests in 4 beautifully appointed cabins. Perfectly suited for family holidays or escapes with friends, FLOW invites guests to discover secluded beaches, hidden coves, and crystalclear bays, while offering generous outdoor spaces for sunbathing, relaxation, and al fresco living. Constructed with a GRP hull and superstructure, and featuring a planing hull design, FLOW combines impressive performance with excellent efficiency. She cruises comfortably at 24 knots and reaches a top speed of 30 knots, allowing guests to explore multiple destinations with ease. Her shallow 1.9m (6'3\") draft enables access to picturesque anchorages and sheltered bays that are beyond the reach of larger yachts. For those seeking adventure, FLOW boasts an outstanding selection of water toys and equipment, ensuring endless fun on the water. Guests can enjoy the thrill of the Jet Ski, experience exciting rides on the towable inflatables, or explore above and below the surface with the SEABOB F5s, offering an exhilarating and effortless way to glide through\nthe sea. A dedicated crew of four professional members is on hand to provide impeccable service throughout your journey, ensuring every moment on board is relaxed, comfortable, and truly unforgettable. Whether you're cruising along spectacular\ncoastlines, enjoying water sports, or unwinding at anchor in a tranquil bay, M/Y FLOW offers the perfect blend of luxury, performance, and unforgettable experiences.",
